<title>UK: BOE allots 250 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 250 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 250 million stg of further assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 79 million stg in bills outright and 171 million stg in repos to May 19.</p>
<p>The repo rate was unchanged at 6.0 percent. The Bank revised its forecast shortage to 1.9 billion stg.</p>
</text>
